aws-enumerator rule catalogue — attribution notice
====================================================

The files in this directory (privesc.json, dangerous.json) are data, shipped as package data and validated
by ../schema.json.

Origin of the rules
-------------------
PRIVESC-001 .. PRIVESC-020 and DANGER-001 .. DANGER-010 are the rules of aws-enumerator itself (d13c215),
converted to the data-driven, resource-scoped, chain-complete format of rules_version 2.0.0.
PRIVESC-021 .. PRIVESC-023 split the existing-resource techniques (UpdateFunctionCode, UpdateDevEndpoint,
StartBuild) out of the PassRole rules (finding F-069). PRIVESC-056 (SageMaker Studio presigned domain URL,
finding F-113), PRIVESC-064 (instance-profile association), PRIVESC-065 (Auto Scaling launch configuration /
template) and PRIVESC-066 / PRIVESC-067 (user / role permissions-boundary removal, finding F-011) are original
to this project as well.

